    "backgroundEN": "For the vocational pathway (Ausbildung): an intermediate school-leaving certificate (mittlerer Schulabschluss) or a recognized equivalent (PflBG §11); the Bagrut qualifies once the state authority recognizes it. No official GPA threshold and no specific science track. For the bachelor: Bagrut meeting the anabin conditions; dual programs require a training contract with a partner institution",
